WEBVTT

00:06:59.156 --> 00:07:03.436
that we have the capacity to empathize
with each other in the first place.

00:07:03.436 --> 00:07:04.716
Our broken hearts,

00:07:04.756 --> 00:07:08.196
taught an 18-century rabbi
named Nahman of Bratslav,

00:07:08.196 --> 00:07:10.276
they connect us to each other

00:07:10.276 --> 00:07:12.836
and to that other world
where the music comes form.

00:07:14.636 --> 00:07:19.156
But modern culture
is telling us a really different story.

00:07:19.156 --> 00:07:23.316
It's telling us to smile
and get over it and move on.

00:07:23.316 --> 00:07:24.636
And of course it's true,

00:07:24.676 --> 00:07:27.636
positivity is very powerful as well.

00:07:27.676 --> 00:07:29.876
And it's possible to get stuck
in your longing

00:07:29.916 --> 00:07:31.236
and to never come out.